# ============================================================
# Process-Scoped Secrets
# ============================================================
# Copy to ~/dotfiles/secrets/.env.secrets and fill in values.
# These are SENSITIVE credentials — API keys, tokens, passwords.
#
# NEVER sourced into the shell. Only injected at runtime via:
#   ~/dotfiles/bin/run-with-secrets.sh python my_script.py
#
# Agents CANNOT access these values by design.
#
# FORMAT: Use full-line comments only. Inline comments (FOO=bar # comment)
# are NOT supported and will corrupt values.
# ============================================================

# --- GitHub ---
# AFK security model uses short-lived GitHub App installation tokens.
# Configure these for AFK credential rotation:
GITHUB_APP_ID=
GITHUB_APP_INSTALLATION_ID=
GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_B64=

# Do not store long-lived GitHub user tokens in this file.
# AFK flows mint short-lived installation tokens from the GitHub App fields above.

# --- OpenAI ---
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- LiteLLM proxy (GitHub Copilot routing) ---
LITELLM_BASE_URL=
LITELLM_MASTER_KEY=

# --- AI Image Generation (uncomment when needed) ---
# REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=
# GLIF_API_TOKEN=

# Local skills may need additional secrets.
# Check each skill's SKILL.md for required configuration.
